0.080 0.280 0.480 rg BT /F2 17 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 726.0 Tm (4. How the workflow works) Tj ET
0.120 0.160 0.220 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 701.0 Tm (The workflow is stored at .github/workflows/python-ci.yml. GitHub recognizes YAML files in this) Tj ET
