0.120 0.220 0.310 rg BT /F3 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 63.0 620.0 Tm (  pull_request:) Tj ET
0.120 0.220 0.310 rg BT /F3 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 63.0 607.0 Tm () Tj ET
0.120 0.220 0.310 rg BT /F3 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 63.0 594.0 Tm (permissions:) Tj ET
0.120 0.220 0.310 rg BT /F3 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 63.0 581.0 Tm (  contents: read) Tj ET
0.120 0.160 0.220 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 561.0 Tm (push runs after commits are pushed. pull_request runs when a pull request is opened or updated.) Tj ET
0.120 0.160 0.220 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 547.0 Tm (contents: read gives the workflow a read-only repository token; it does not need permission to) Tj ET
0.120 0.160 0.220 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 533.0 Tm (change source code.) Tj ET
0.080 0.280 0.480 rg BT /F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 512.0 Tm (The build-test job) Tj ET
0.120 0.160 0.220 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.0 492.0 Tm (- Runs on a fresh Ubuntu runner hosted by GitHub.) Tj ET
0.120 0.160 0.220 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.0 475.0 Tm (- Checks out the repository, sets up Python 3.11, and installs requirements.txt.) Tj ET
0.120 0.160 0.220 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.0 458.0 Tm (- Runs python -m flake8 app.py test_app.py to check style and common errors.) Tj ET
