0.120 0.160 0.220 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 300.0 Tm (registry.) Tj ET
0.080 0.280 0.480 rg BT /F2 17 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 279.0 Tm (5. What Docker does here) Tj ET
0.120 0.160 0.220 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 254.0 Tm (A Docker image is a packaged filesystem and instructions for running software. The Dockerfile) Tj ET
0.120 0.160 0.220 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 240.0 Tm (starts from python:3.11-slim, sets /app as the working directory, installs the requirements,) Tj ET
