0.080 0.280 0.480 rg BT /F2 17 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 726.0 Tm (6. Run the checks locally) Tj ET
0.120 0.220 0.310 rg BT /F3 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 63.0 701.0 Tm (python -m pip install -r requirements.txt) Tj ET
