0.120 0.160 0.220 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 641.0 Tm (commit and push. A new push starts another workflow run.) Tj ET
0.080 0.280 0.480 rg BT /F2 17 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 620.0 Tm (7. Current scope and what comes later) Tj ET
0.120 0.160 0.220 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.0 595.0 Tm (- This is a demonstration, not a deployed web service. The Python functions are not exposed) Tj ET
0.120 0.160 0.220 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.0 581.0 Tm (through a web API.) Tj ET
0.120 0.160 0.220 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.0 564.0 Tm (- The Docker image is built but not published to Docker Hub or another registry.) Tj ET
0.120 0.160 0.220 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.0 547.0 Tm (- The Dockerfile defaults to running tests, so it is currently a test image rather than a) Tj ET
0.120 0.160 0.220 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.0 533.0 Tm (production app image.) Tj ET
0.120 0.160 0.220 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.0 516.0 Tm (- Security scanning is a future extension. Typical additions include dependency) Tj ET
0.120 0.160 0.220 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.0 502.0 Tm (vulnerability checks, Bandit for Python security findings, and container image scanning.) Tj ET
0.120 0.160 0.220 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.0 485.0 Tm (- A later deployment stage would need a real runtime command, a registry, deployment target,) Tj ET
0.120 0.160 0.220 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.0 471.0 Tm (and carefully scoped credentials.) Tj ET
0.080 0.280 0.480 rg BT /F2 17 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 450.0 Tm (8. Key terms) Tj ET
0.120 0.160 0.220 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.0 425.0 Tm (- CI \(Continuous Integration\): automatically check code changes frequently.) Tj ET
0.120 0.160 0.220 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.0 408.0 Tm (- CD \(Continuous Delivery/Deployment\): automatically prepare or release tested software.) Tj ET
0.120 0.160 0.220 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.0 391.0 Tm (- Linting: static checks for style and common code problems; it does not prove the program) Tj ET
0.120 0.160 0.220 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.0 377.0 Tm (is correct.) Tj ET
0.120 0.160 0.220 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.0 360.0 Tm (- Unit test: a small automated check of one part of a program.) Tj ET
0.120 0.160 0.220 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.0 343.0 Tm (- Container image: a packaged template used to create containers.) Tj ET
0.120 0.160 0.220 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.0 326.0 Tm (- Workflow/job/step: a GitHub Actions workflow contains jobs; each job contains steps.) Tj ET
0.120 0.160 0.220 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.0 309.0 Tm (- Dependency: an external package the project installs, such as pytest.) Tj ET
0.080 0.280 0.480 rg BT /F2 17 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 288.0 Tm (9. Quick review) Tj ET
0.120 0.160 0.220 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 263.0 Tm (Try answering these without looking back:) Tj ET
0.120 0.160 0.220 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.0 246.0 Tm (- What must pass before the Docker build job starts?) Tj ET
0.120 0.160 0.220 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.0 229.0 Tm (- What does contents: read permit the workflow to do?) Tj ET
0.120 0.160 0.220 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.0 212.0 Tm (- Does this workflow publish the built image?) Tj ET
0.120 0.160 0.220 rg BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.0 195.0 Tm (- What happens when divide\(1, 0\) is called?) Tj ET
0.080 0.280 0.480 rg BT /F2 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 178.0 Tm (Answers: lint and tests; read repository contents only; no, it only builds; the function raises) Tj ET
0.080 0.280 0.480 rg BT /F2 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 164.0 Tm (ValueError.) Tj ET
